  "info": "Example: Infinite Movie AutoPrompt -> LLM_Multitool (external LLM) -> Infinite Movie Render.\n\nThe AutoPrompt node generates a meta-prompt (system + user) for the transition.\nThe LLM_Multitool node sends it to an external LLM (e.g. BeeLlama router, Ollama, OpenAI).\nThe response is used as the shot prompt for the render.\n\nSet api_key_env to the NAME of your environment variable (e.g. GEMINI_API_KEY).\nEnable clean_output for direct use as a render prompt."
